    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d176">

                <pb facs="0365" n="359" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg359"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Stevens to Mr.
                            Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 57.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Honolulu</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-06-11"><hi rendition="#italic">June 11,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I forward herewith two copied of Her
                    Majesty’s speech at the opening of the Legislature, May 28. Of what is
                    transpiring in that body and all of importance that may be done the first month
                    of its session I will give an account in a future dispatch.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John L. Stevens.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d176-a1.xml" xpointer="d176-a1"/>
